[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3772098603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115159#issuecomment-3772098603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115159","id":3772098603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7g1agr","user":{"login":"ASamBlur","id":199510196,"node_id":"U_kgDOC-RItA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199510196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur","html_url":"https://github.com/ASamBlur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ASamBlur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T10:16:34Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T10:16:34Z","body":"It seems like a floating point error:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/78c6632eb174aabb2790975cf83e28fee065b43d/core/math/vector2.cpp#L144-L148\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/78c6632eb174aabb2790975cf83e28fee065b43d/core/math/math_funcs.cpp#L121-L126","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3772098603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776002906","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115159#issuecomment-3776002906","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115159","id":3776002906,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hETta","user":{"login":"mrgreenapple24","id":172022195,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkDZsw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172022195?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrgreenapple24","html_url":"https://github.com/mrgreenapple24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrgreenapple24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrgreenapple24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrgreenapple24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrgreenapple24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrgreenapple24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrgreenapple24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrgreenapple24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrgreenapple24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrgreenapple24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T03:49:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T03:49:26Z","body":"Godot 3 uses 32-bit floats (float), not doubles.\n\n0.01 cannot be represented exactly in binary floating point. Internally, it becomes something like:  0.009999999776...\n\nSo when snapped() does its math (roughly divide → round → multiply), the result is numerically correct, but the printed decimal shows the underlying approximation: Vector2(1.24, 265.630005)\n\nUse stepify in godot 3.x\n\n`func _ready():\n\tvar k = Vector2(1.23554876, 265.631546)\n\tk.x = stepify(k.x, 0.01)\n\tk.y = stepify(k.y, 0.01)\n\tprint(k)\n`\n\nUse snapped only for godot 4.x as godot 4 has 64 bit floating point numbers so the change would be much less noticable","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3776002906/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]